%% 1. Queue row status (orchestrator.run_batch / download_with_retry -> ui on_item)
stateDiagram-v2
    [*] --> resolving: not in history, not gallery
    [*] --> skipped: already in history (not force)
    [*] --> queued: gallery mode (no resolve)
    resolving --> queued: one row per resolved video
    queued --> downloading: download_with_retry starts
    downloading --> merging: yt-dlp "finished" hook
    merging --> downloading: next stream (audio after video)
    downloading --> retrying: transient failure, attempts left
    retrying --> downloading: next attempt
    downloading --> done: success (history.add)
    merging --> done
    downloading --> failed: permanent or attempts exhausted
    retrying --> failed
    done --> [*]
    failed --> [*]
    skipped --> [*]

